{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_150300_p20_b27", "persona_id": "db:20", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "1. 在客户明确预算并准备下单时，若产品未上市，应提前准备预售政策或替代方案，避免直接降级为意向登记。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_150750"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_150300_p20_b27", "persona_id": "db:20", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "2. 开场阶段应包含破冰和空间给予（如warmup_greeting），避免连续使用soft_hook导致客户反感。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_150750"}
