{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_150300_p20_b27", "persona_id": "db:20", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "4. 在S3阶段应更充分地使用align_3a、anchor_3a等动作，巩固价值锚定后再推进成交，避免过早进入价格讨论。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_150750"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_150300_p20_b27", "persona_id": "db:20", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "5. 对于价格敏感型客户，应在价值锚定充分后再报价，并用收益量化（如省眼药水次数）来支撑价格合理性。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_150750"}
